GraceUI
=======

GraceUI's own code is under the MIT License: see LICENSE.

graceui.dll also contains the third-party code below, compiled into its grace-host module only (D107, invariant 16).
GraceUI's build downloads each file at configure time from the project's own repository, at the commit of the pinned
tag, and checks it against its SHA-256 (cmake/third_party.cmake); no copy is kept in this repository. Changing either
version needs the owner's approval, after its licence files are read again (D107). Both licences were read in full on
2026-11-16: neither has a clause on the use of AI. Dear ImGui's pull-request template asks its contributors not to send
AI-generated prose; that is a rule for contributions to that project, not a term of its licence, and GraceUI sends it
nothing.

The Microsoft C runtime is linked into graceui.dll statically, under Microsoft's terms for its redistribution; the
runtime and the Windows SDK are downloaded by xwin outside every repository and are never kept in one (BUILD.md).


