Dear ImGui includes, and graceui.dll therefore contains:

- stb_rect_pack, stb_textedit and stb_truetype (imstb_*.h), by Sean Barrett, under a choice of the MIT License
  (Copyright (c) 2017 Sean Barrett; the text is the MIT text above, with that line) or the public domain; GraceUI takes
  them under the MIT License.
- The ProggyClean font, embedded in imgui_draw.cpp: MIT License, Copyright (c) 2004, 2005 Tristan Grimmer (the text is
  the MIT text above, with that line).
- The ProggyForever font, minimal version, embedded in imgui_draw.cpp: MIT License, Copyright (c) 2026 Disco Hello,
  Copyright (c) 2019,2023 Tristan Grimmer (the text is the MIT text above, with those lines).

GraceUI's build leaves out Dear ImGui's obsolete functions (IMGUI_DISABLE_OBSOLETE_FUNCTIONS), and with them the table
of Japanese characters that imgui_draw.cpp otherwise holds.


